Atlatl =
The [[eclipse atlatl]] can outshine a [[rosewood blowpipe]], especially if your [[Strength]] level is above your Ranged level, and if wearing melee strength gear. As a rule of thumb: with equal Ranged and Strength levels, an atlatl with "mid-game" strength items (around 40 strength bonus not including the atlatl) matches a rosewood blowpipe with [[elite Void Knight equipment|elite void]] and no other ranged strength items. Most items that can give melee strength will also be easier to obtain or cheaper to purchase compared to those that provide ranged strength, allowing the atlatl to reach most of its potential damage earlier.
<br>
